/><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-18 14:00<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FEQSZANRxEaD5Us4AWiqPIA\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EQSZANRxEaD5Us4AWiqPIA</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br /><center>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息102.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/ca/pim98mfinvu0zdjk1t1glm95gv5gt3d.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" /><br /><br />\n团长们！<font color=\"brown\"><b>好消息！好消息！</b></font><br />\n《铃兰之剑》现已开启<font color=\"brown\"><b>多渠道预约</b></font>！<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>丰富福利</b></font>等你来预约解锁<br />\n赶紧跟着小场记一起来看看吧~<br />\n</p>\n<img alt=\"官方消息169.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/20/4a2anfku8rub6sgqmmnovp90o8pvske.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"309\" height=\"339\" data-file-width=\"309\" data-file-height=\"339\" /><br /></center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">官网预约</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n <center>团长们可以点击<font color=\"brown\"><b>【阅读原文】</b></font>直接前往《铃兰之剑》官网，通过手机号进行快速预约！<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息170.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/ae/9he5j1y2brszvp4e8uh0hp99oiqwxah.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"510\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"510\" /><br /></center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">商店预约</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p><font color=\"brown\"><b>ios用户</b></font>可前往<font color=\"brown\"><b>苹果App store商店</b></font>，搜索<font color=\"brown\"><b> 铃兰之剑：为这和平的世界 </b></font>点击<font color=\"brown\"><b>【获取】</b></font>即可预约成功。（ps：一定要搜索全名哦~）<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息171.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/bd/nc1k86eecbjuy4a0dqr05jmkzo88dqa.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"897\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"897\" /><br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>安卓用户</b></font>可前往<font color=\"brown\"><b>TapTap</b></font>，搜索进入 <font color=\"brown\"><b>铃兰之剑 </b></font>游戏专区，点击<font color=\"brown\"><b>【预约】</b></font>即可完成。<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息172.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/65/hv4jiamxd9fl0a6zoc0k46mt81zs0b6.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"687\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"687\" /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">预约福利</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>现在完成预约可获得游戏福利<font color=\"brown\"><b>【乐土币*5000】【公共经验值*2000】【秘缘*1】</b></font>，更有<font color=\"brown\"><b>累计预约福利</b></font>等着团长解锁。（ps：选择以上任意方式进行预约均可获得福利哦~）<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息173.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/58/p61tjwf46v5w6la746s1rzd6v3awyu6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"780\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"780\" /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>请团长们相信<br />\n<p><font color=\"brown\"><b>等待</b></font>是为了<font color=\"brown\"><b>更好的相遇</b></font><br />\n感谢大家一直以来的<font color=\"brown\"><b>支持与喜爱</b></font><br />\n我们也共同期待着<font color=\"brown\"><b>相见</b></font>的那一天<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>为这和平的世界！</b></font><br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息138.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b0/pdkoq2bc59leqjtmh9hij43e1io77b3.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022112421\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 143/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2338/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,templ